  "solution": "What is the value of the following expression?\n\n420 ÷ [(4)/(9) times(1+(4)/(5)) times 5] + [(5)/(7) { of } (21)/(25) div (3)/(4) { of } (2)/(5)]\n\n**Calculations:**\n\nPart 1: Calculate (4)/(9) times (1+(4)/(5)) times 5\n\n⇒ (1+(4)/(5)) = (9)/(5)\n\n⇒ (4)/(9) times (9)/(5) times 5\n\n⇒ (4 times 9 times 5)/(9 times 5) = 4\n\nPart 2: Calculate (5)/(7) { of } (21)/(25) div (3)/(4) { of } (2)/(5)\n\n⇒ (5)/(7) times (21)/(25) div ((3)/(4) times (2)/(5))\n\n⇒ (3)/(4) times (2)/(5) = (6)/(20) = (3)/(10)\n\n⇒ (5)/(7) times (21)/(25) div (3)/(10)\n\n⇒ (5)/(7) times (21)/(25) times (10)/(3)\n\n⇒ (5 times 21 times 10)/(7 times 25 times 3)\n\n⇒ (1050)/(525) = 2\n\n**Final Expression:**\n\n⇒ (420)/(4) + 2\n\n⇒ 105 + 2 = 107\n\n**∴ The value of the expression is 107.**",
